{
 "difference_id": "Tb583a1fc",
 "property_summary": "For any list of recipients, the reference transfer must invoke the external token contract exactly once per distinct recipient with the caller-supplied amount, so a recording callee must observe a transferFrom call for every _tos element; the buggy version increments i by i*=2, skipping all but the first destination, so for any input with at least two elements the recorded call count (or which recipient was observed) is wrong.",
 "render_status": "rendered",
 "validation_status": "passed",
